<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers initiated coverage of FPA Medical Management Inc and MedQuist Inc as buy, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- FPA rose 3/4 to 23-1/8, while Medquist was up 1/4 to 19-1/2.</p>
</text>
